Package: bisimulationrs
Title: Analyse and Compare PEPA Performance Models
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Jan", "Vandepitte", , "jan.vandepitte@mateco.eu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Checks PEPA (Performance Evaluation Process Algebra) models,
    derives their state space as a continuous-time Markov chain, merges
    equivalent states by Markovian bisimulation, computes behaviour over
    time, and explains how two models differ with distinguishing formulas.
    The analysis runs in Rust; results are returned as data frames. Times
    are in seconds and rates in events per second.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
